# UX workflow: enable a sequencer step, open step edit, adjust a value, and close.
# Purpose: validates sequencer step toggling, long-press edit overlay, focused
# row navigation, OPT value editing, and overlay close.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Toggle the first visible step.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
300 capture screen step_enabled

# Long-press the same step to open the step edit overlay.
400 button MACRO_1 down
1450 tick
1500 capture screen step_edit_open
1550 button MACRO_1 up

# Move focus and edit the focused step property.
1650 encoder NAV 1
1750 encoder OPT 0.65
1850 capture screen step_edit_adjusted

# Close the edit overlay.
1950 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2150 capture screen step_edit_closed
